# Rust build artifacts
target/
**/target/
**/src-tauri/gen/
# Cargo.lock IS committed: this is an application/binary workspace, so the lock must be tracked for
# reproducible CI builds. (It was ignored, which let CI resolve a broken pgvector/sqlx 0.8 combo —
# pgvector::Vector not implementing sqlx 0.8 traits — that the committed lock pins away from.)
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

